---

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="section-label">// 01</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="about.title">About me</h2>
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-text reveal">
                <p data-i18n="about.p1">I'm <strong>Mohamed Abdelaziz</strong>, a <strong>Computer &amp; Systems Engineering</strong> student at <a href="https://www.minia.edu.eg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Minya University</a>, passionate about game development, cybersecurity, and building cool things that actually work.</p>
                <p data-i18n="about.p2">I've shipped multiplayer Unity games, built AI assistants on tiny hardware, written Python automation tools, and explored both sides of cybersecurity. I like going deep on things that most people would just use off the shelf.</p>
                <p data-i18n="about.p3">When I'm not coding, I'm playing games, watching anime, or overclocking hardware to do things it absolutely shouldn't.</p>
                <div class="currently-block">
                    <div class="currently-header" data-i18n="about.currently">// currently</div>
                    <div class="currently-row">
                        <span class="currently-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i></span>
                        <span class="currently-label" data-i18n="about.workLabel">Working on</span>
                        <span class="currently-val" data-i18n="about.workVal">Game Dev &amp; Security tools</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="currently-row">
                        <span class="currently-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i></span>
                        <span class="currently-label" data-i18n="about.playLabel">Playing</span>
                        <span class="currently-val" data-i18n="about.playVal">indie games + jams</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="currently-row">
                        <span class="currently-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i></span>
                        <span class="currently-label" data-i18n="about.learnLabel">Learning</span>
                        <span class="currently-val" data-i18n="about.learnVal">Cybersecurity / Flutter</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stats reveal">
                <div class="stat-row">
                    <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat.location">location</span>
                    <span class="stat-value" data-i18n="stat.locVal">Egypt 🇪🇬</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-row">
                    <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat.role">role</span>
                    <span class="stat-value" data-i18n="stat.roleVal">Engineering Student</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-row">
                    <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat.org">org</span>
                    <span class="stat-value" data-i18n="stat.orgVal">Minya University</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-row">
                    <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat.langs">main langs</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">C# · Python · Dart</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-row">
                    <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat.github">github</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">DsMans0021</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-row">
                    <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat.status">status</span>
                    <span class="stat-value"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-i18n="stat.statusVal">available</span></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
